From b557e4b82c24fd342fa29836d8076d284efe91a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sun, 14 Jun 2026 10:39:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] fix: Bring FFA/conditional loot into the merged window
 (I-137)

Instead of routing FFA/conditional items to bags, inject them into the
main loot window via Loot::AddNonNormalLootItemFor, which registers them
in mainLoot's per-player display lists so they show and loot normally.
Plain items now also push directly into mainLoot. All merged copies are
scoped to the looter (rollWinnerGUID + is_underthreshold) so other group
members can't see or grab them. Over-threshold non-FFA items still stay
on their corpse for the group roll; quest items still go to bags.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
